/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E ( The interior is blindingly bright and disturbingly empty. Because the walls are glass and there is a massive hole \(an Oculus\) in the ceiling, there are no shadows to hide in. The grandness of the exterior was a lie; inside, there is no furniture, no warmth, just a hollow, echoing chamber of glass and steel. Those inside desperately stretch toward the hole in the roof, reaching for the sky they can see but never touch.)
